/-
ToeFormal/Derivation/QFTGRMinimalWorkingModelRefinementAttemptAfterPostRetestRefinementConservationRetest

Lean-side marker for the QFT-GR minimal working model bounded refinement
attempt after repeated inconclusive conservation retests. The attempt consumes
the repeated-inconclusive refinement-packet result review, executes only the
authorized obstruction-class refinement of the weak pairing domain, regularity
assumptions, test-function class, candidate source definition, scope
restriction, obstruction accounting, and validation boundary, and selects the
attempt-result review. It does not rerun conservation, claim source
admissibility, prove conservation, construct a conservation proof object or
witness, claim Bianchi compatibility, derive the semiclassical Einstein
equation, close QFT-GR, validate empirically, authorize public submission, or
promote the master action.
-/

